{% ctaSection
   heading="What is Bold?"
   description="The BOLD Program is a gap year program for graduated high school seniors through recent college graduates (or age 19-24). Through Christ-centered discipleship, we are equipping individuals to become apprentices of Jesus while connecting them to future career paths, engaging in spiritual formation, participating in community living, developing mentoring relationships, immersing them into diverse experiences, and serving the communities we live in."
   buttonLabel="APPLY NOW"
