{% ctaSection
   heading="Our Mission"
   description="Our primary goal is to cultivate ambassadors for Christ—young men and women who are rooted in their identity in Christ and committed to walking as Jesus walked in every area of their life. Our mission is not simply to prepare good producers for the workforce—we want young people to enter the world knowing that they are first and foremost givers—people created in the image of God and called to reflect the character of Christ"
   variant="brown"
   external=false %}
## 
{% /ctaSection %}

{% ctaSection
   heading="Our Vision"
   description="Our vision is to cultivate a Gospel-centered community where young people are equipped to know Christ, grow in confidence, and become servant leaders who are prepared to thrive in the world around them."
   variant="brown"
   external=false /%}

{% ctaSection
   heading="The Story behind BOLD"
   description="BOLD—Biblically Oriented Leadership Development—was born from the desire to prepare young adults for more than a career while giving them opportunities to engage the workforce and try different job interests. We want to help them understand who they are in Christ, why they believe what they believe, and how their faith shapes the way they work, lead, serve, rest, and engage the world."
   buttonLabel="Learn More"
   buttonHref="/about-bold"
   variant="green"
   external=false /%}
